# Cloudflare Pages security headers.
#
# NOTE: no Content-Security-Policy beyond frame-ancestors. The site runs inline
# scripts, GA4/gtag, Google Fonts, Tailwind and Web3Forms, so an unscoped policy
# would break rendering and the lead forms. Land one separately as
# Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only first.
#
# HSTS has no `preload`: that is an effectively irreversible browser-preload-list
# commitment and needs owner sign-off. includeSubDomains is safe — www and blog
# are the only subdomains and both serve valid HTTPS (301 -> apex).

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
